34.140">of </span><span begin="01:34.140" end="01:34.380">their </span><span begin="01:34.380" end="01:35.910">minds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.510" end="01:40.920"><span begin="01:36.510" end="01:36.780">How </span><span begin="01:36.780" end="01:37.200">could </span><span begin="01:37.200" end="01:37.410">I </span><span begin="01:37.410" end="01:37.650">be </span><span begin="01:37.650" end="01:37.920">so </span><span begin="01:37.920" end="01:38.910">foolish </span><span begin="01:38.910" end="01:39.240">（</span><span begin="01:39.240" end="01:39.480">How </span><span begin="01:39.480" end="01:39.780">could </span><span begin="01:39.780" end="01:40.050">I</span><span begin="01:40.050" end="01:40.920">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.920" end="01:44.340"><span begin="01:40.920" end="01:41.250">To </span><span begin="01:41.250" end="01:41.550">not </span><span begin="01:41.550" end="01:41.880">see </span><span begin="01:41.880" end="01:42.120">I </span><span begin="01:42.120" end="01:42.450">was </span><span begin="01:42.450" end="01:42.660">the </span><span begin="01:42.660" end="01:42.990">one </span><span begin="01:42.990" end="01:44.340">behind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.300" end="01:48.240"><span begin="01:45.300" end="01:45.600">So </span><span begin="01:45.600" end="01:46.020">still </span><span begin="01:46.020" end="01:46.170">I </span><span begin="01:46.170" end="01:46.590">kept </span><span begin="01:46.590" end="01:46.830">on </span><span begin="01:46.830" end="01:48.240">fighting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.200" end="01:54.150"><span begin="01:49.200" end="01:50.130">Well</span><span begin="01:50.130" end="01:50.130">, </span><span begin="01:50.130" end="01:50.790">loosing </span><span begin="01:50.790" end="01:51.120">every </span><span begin="01:51.120" end="01:51.570">step </span><span begin="01:51.570" end="01:51.810">of </span><span begin="01:51.810" end="01:51.990">the </span><span begin="01:51.990" end="01:54.150">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.240" end="01:58.710"><span begin="01:54.240" end="01:54.450">I </span><span begin="01:54.450" end="01:54.780">said</span><span begin="01:54.780" end="01:54.780">, </span><span begin="01:54.780" end="01:54.960">I </span><span begin="01:54.960" end="01:55.350">must </span><span begin="01:55.350" end="01:55.530">go </span><span begin="01:55.530" end="01:55.920">back </span><span begin="01:55.920" end="01:56.580">there </span><span begin="01:56.580" end="01:57.000">（</span><span begin="01:57.000" end="01:57.090">I </span><span begin="01:57.090" end="01:57.300">got </span><span begin="01:57.300" end="01:57.420">to </span><span begin="01:57.420" end="01:57.600">go </span><span begin="01:57.600" end="01:58.050">back</span><span begin="01:58.050" end="01:58.710">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.710" end="02:02.160"><span begin="01:58.710" end="01:58.980">And </span><span begin="01:58.980" end="01:59.310">check </span><span begin="01:59.310" end="01:59.430">to </span><span begin="01:59.430" end="01:59.820">see </span><span begin="01:59.820" end="02:00.000">if </span><span begin="02:00.000" end="02:00.390">things </span><span begin="02:00.390" end="02:00.660">still </span><span begin="02:00.660" end="02:00.780">the </span><span begin="02:00.780" end="02:02.160">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.460" end="02:07.530"><span begin="02:02.460" end="02:02.820">Yea </span><span begin="02:02.820" end="02:03.060">they </span><span begin="02:03.060" end="02:03.360">were </span><span begin="02:03.360" end="02:04.200">dancin' </span><span begin="02:04.200" end="02:04.410">and </span><span begin="02:04.410" end="02:05.250">singin' </span><span begin="02:05.250" end="02:05.580">and </span><span begin="02:05.580" end="02:06.090">movin' </span><span begin="02:06.090" end="02:06.390">to </span><span begin="02:06.390" end="02:06.480">the </span><span begin="02:06.480" end="02:07.530">groovin'</span></p><p tt